E.1 Compute Capacity Time Series Construction

Primary source: Epoch AI Notable AI Models Dataset (epochai.org/data/notable-ai-models), supplemented by hyperscaler (Google, Microsoft, Meta, Amazon, Huawei, Alibaba, Tencent, Baidu) annual reports and SEC filings.

Procedure:

