where:

· $\mathcal{G}$: set of GPU/ASIC generations active in year $t$
· $N_{gnt}$: units of generation $g$ deployed in nation $n$ at time $t$
· $\phi_g$: peak throughput of generation $g$ at BF16/FP8 precision
· $u_{gnt}$: average utilization rate (from cloud provider utilization reports)
· $\eta_{nt}$: nation-specific system efficiency (accounting for interconnect, cooling, etc.)

