E.4 Research Capital Time Series Construction

Primary source: Semantic Scholar API (api.semanticscholar.org) for publication and citation counts.

Procedure:

1. Query AI publications (filtered by arXiv cs.AI, cs.CL, cs.CV, cs.LG, stat.ML categories) with author affiliations mapped to nations.
