3. Elite talent concentration adjustment:

R_{nt}^{\text{elite}} = N_{nt}^{\text{highly\_cited}} / N_t^{\text{global\_highly\_cited}}

where highly-cited is defined as top 1% by citations in AI fields.

4. Normalize to [0,1]:

R_{nt} = \frac{R_{nt}^{\text{raw}} + \lambda R_{nt}^{\text{elite}}}{\max_{n,t}(R_{nt}^{\text{raw}} + \lambda R_{nt}^{\text{elite}})}

with $\lambda = 2$ (elite concentration weighted double).

