E.5 Software Ecosystem Depth: Graph-Theoretic Implementation

Procedure for λ_centrality:

1. Construct directed graph $G = (V, E, w)$ from:
   · PyPI dependency metadata (pypi.org)
   · npm dependency trees
   · GitHub repository dependency graphs (github.com)
   · HuggingFace model card "used by" relationships
2. Filter to AI/ML-relevant packages via keyword matching and community tagging.
3. Compute PageRank (personalized restart probability 0.15, convergence threshold $10^{-8}$):

\mathbf{PR} = (1 - d) \cdot \mathbf{v} + d \cdot \mathbf{M} \cdot \mathbf{PR}

where $\mathbf{M}$ is the column-stochastic transition matrix and $\mathbf{v}$ is the teleportation vector.

4. Assign packages to nations based on maintainer institutional affiliation (majority rule for multi-maintainer packages).
5. Compute $\lambda_{\text{centrality}}(N) = \sum_{v \in V_N} \mathbf{PR}[v] / \sum_{v \in V} \mathbf{PR}[v]$.

